{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Obakeyashiki&quot; is a first-person exploration adventure game where you search for an exit from a maze-like haunted house.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25c6 Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2015\u2015 &quot;Welcome to the haunted house.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You visit a mansion that has been turned entirely into a haunted house by its owner, who built it to entertain visitors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2015\u2015 &quot;I've prepared five exits.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once you step inside, you can't leave until you find one of the exits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Of the five possible exits, one has a guided path prepared for it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To find the others, you\u2019ll need to leave the main path and explore the maze-like house on your own.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No combat. No game over. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25c6 Controls</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >WASD \u2014 Move</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Left Click \u2014 Interact</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tab \u2014 Inventory</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Esc \u2014 Settings</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25c6Video Uploads and Streaming</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Posting videos and streaming the game are very welcome.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It would be great if you could include a link to the store page in the description.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Red Door","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3776410/1c6fd02995e1a6d84f8ed731f556740822cc990d.jpg"},{"name":"Blue Door","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3776410/e7bed565913ad6683df7687b501fb6024dd03d65.jpg"},{"name":"Yellow Door","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunit